The VM base image (image/) is built on exeuntu by Bold Software, the image
of exe.dev, also under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/boldsoftware/exeuntu
image/Dockerfile starts from a pinned exeuntu release and adds our layer:
image/boxe-init, image/boxe-welcome.sh, image/sshd-boxe.conf,
image/ssh-early.conf, image/boxe-sshkeys.service, and the changes made by the
RUN steps of image/Dockerfile (SSH as a plain service, no nologin, welcome
message, instructions for coding agents).

The image also includes Shelley by Bold Software, under the Apache License
2.0, unmodified: https://github.com/boldsoftware/shelley
image/shelley-socket.conf and image/shelley-service.conf change how it is
started (port, no exe.dev gateway).
